    {
      "id": "b1-ch2",
      "title": "Narrating the Past",
      "subtitle": "Рассказываем о прошлом: Past Continuous против Past Simple, конструкция used to, союзы while и when",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "b1-ch2-l1",
          "title": "Past Continuous vs Past Simple",
          "summary": "Учимся описывать фон действия и внезапные события в прошлом с помощью while и when.",
          "estimatedMinutes": 11,
          "exercises": [
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex1",
              "type": "info",
              "title": "Past Continuous vs Past Simple",
              "explanation": "Past Continuous (was/were + глагол -ing) описывает длительное действие в процессе, а Past Simple — короткое действие, которое его прервало. Например: I was sleeping when the phone rang.",
              "difficulty": 1,
              "topics": [
                "b1-past-continuous"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex2",
              "type": "flashcard",
              "prompt": "was watching",
              "translation": "смотрел (в тот момент)",
              "example": "I was watching TV when you called.",
              "difficulty": 1,
              "topics": [
                "b1-past-continuous",
                "b1-while-when"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex3",
              "type": "flashcard",
              "prompt": "suddenly",
              "translation": "внезапно, вдруг",
              "example": "We were talking when suddenly the lights went out.",
              "difficulty": 1,
              "topics": [
                "b1-past-continuous",
                "b1-while-when"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex4",
              "type": "multiple_choice",
              "prompt": "I ___ a book when the doorbell rang.",
              "options": [
                "was reading",
                "read",
                "am reading"
              ],
              "correctOption": "was reading",
              "explanation": "Длительное действие в процессе — Past Continuous.",
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b1-past-continuous",
                "b1-while-when"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex5",
              "type": "multiple_choice",
              "prompt": "While she was cooking, she ___ her finger.",
              "options": [
                "cut",
                "was cutting",
                "cuts"
              ],
              "correctOption": "cut",
              "explanation": "Короткое действие, прервавшее фон — Past Simple.",
              "difficulty": 2,
              "topics": [
                "b1-past-continuous",
                "b1-while-when"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex6",
              "type": "info",
              "title": "while и when",
              "explanation": "While обычно ставят перед длительным действием (Past Continuous), а when — перед коротким (Past Simple): While I was walking, when it started to rain.",
              "difficulty": 1,
              "topics": [
                "b1-past-continuous"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b1-ch2-l1-ex7",
              "type": "translate",
              "prompt": "Что ты делал вчера вечером?",
              "canonicalAnswer": "What were you doing last night?",
              "acceptedAnswers": [
